SUMMARY: THURSDAY (Free event) The Challenges of Modern Dating (July 2nd) 
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello everyone\,\n\n(Free Online E
 vent)\n\nJoin us for an open and thought-provoking workshop exploring the 
 challenges of modern dating in today's fast-changing world. Together we'll
  discuss topics such as online dating\, communication\, expectations\, lon
 eliness\, emotional health\, building meaningful relationships\, and the q
 ualities that help create lasting connections\, all within a respectful\, 
 welcoming environment that encourages honest conversation\, personal growt
 h\, and practical insights.\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\nPlease be respectful and courteous to ev
 eryone who attends :)\n\nArrival Time:\nPlease join us between 8:00 pm and
  8:10 pm (if you can)\nThe conversation begins right away :)\n\n***\n\nCam
 era's On Please :)\n\nHosted by Steve Flemming\n\n**Zoom link:**\nhttps://
 us04web.zoom.us/j/495043928\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\n**Bonus:**\n**Stick around after the event for St
 eve Flemming Presents: Songs and Stories that Stir the Soul**\nhttps://www
 .meetup.com/soulcity/events/315427766/
